---
/** Homepage section: agentic AI capability + CTA to /agent */
---

<section class="border-t-[3px] border-accent bg-surface-elevated">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-muted">After the warehouse</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Agentic AI on your operational data
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-lg">
          Once daily work lives in trustworthy systems, we connect a <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">data
          agent</strong> to the warehouse and tools you already use. Your team can
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">ask anything about the data it has</strong>—shipments,
          exceptions, fill rate, trends—without exporting five spreadsheets.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Guardrails stay on your data boundary: the agent reasons over connected context, not the open
          internet. We scope access, logging, and escalation with you—not a black box.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="/agent" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">Try the interactive demo</a>
          <a href="/audit" class="btn-ghost-light w-full sm:w-auto">Start an audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="rounded-sm border border-border bg-surface p-5 shadow-sm md:p-6"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-muted">Preview</p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          <p class="rounded-sm border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-3 py-2 text-ink">
            <span class="text-ink-muted">You:</span> Which customers had the most late shipments last month?
          </p>
          <p class="rounded-sm border-l-2 border-accent bg-surface-elevated px-3 py-2 text-ink">
            <span class="text-ink-muted">Agent:</span> Apex Industrial led with 47 late lines—mostly warehouse B
            pick backlog…
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-muted">
          Demo uses sample distributor data. No API keys on this site.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>